{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>作為越南中部的海濱度假勝地，峴港除了陽光與海灘，咖啡文化亦相當有驚喜，當地的景觀咖啡店在空間設計上可謂花盡心思。\n</p>\n<p>這次為大家精選6間峴港話題咖啡店，由懸崖邊浮空卡座、無邊際泳池中央的水中梳化，到充滿異國風情的摩洛哥泥黃階梯、藍白愛琴海露台，以至被綠意包圍的採光玻璃屋，開揚視野隨時比餐點更吸引呢～</p>\n<p>🩵留言「cafe」send 6間Cafe的詳細資料你～</p>\n<p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令你念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316723826761018_2335870046ae18f88a7830.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179316723826761018_2335870046ae18f88a7830.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@chu.chu.eat)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfBhsQfPWVC/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%b3%b4%e6%b8%afcafe/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">峴港Cafe</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b5%b7%e6%99%af%e9%a4%90%e5%bb%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">海景餐廳</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%b6%8a%e5%8d%97%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">越南旅遊</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@chu.chu.eat資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DfBhsQfPWVC/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nOct 28 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:21:17.850326+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":414,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip",